WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Name a reusable action
Use def to define a function. Put parameters in parentheses and indent the body. Call the function by its name.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Send a result back
return sends a value back to the calling code. It does not print the value automatically.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Follow the input and output
The caller supplies 3 as n. Inside the function, n * 2 evaluates to 6. return gives that value back to the caller.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Ready for your final set exam?
Exercise 2 checks def and return. Review conditions, loops, indentation, and function results before the final exam.
